  "body": "Fork synced at v0.18.0. Effort: medium (no escalation).\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\nAdds a guide section `site/content/guide/multi-axis/` (docs only), linked once from `site/content/guide/_index.md`:\r\n- `_index.md`: the four kinds, and the shipped machines with a rotary (`doosan-dnm`, `tormach-770mx-microarc4`, `tilthead`, `millturn`), plus a link to `docs/MACHINE-ONBOARDING.md`.\r\n- `machines-and-tcp.md`: table vs head vs tilt-head, reach and limits, TCP/RTCP per post, the no-TCP case (#950).\r\n- `indexed.md`: 3+1 and 3+2 via the \"Tilted plane (3+2)\" group; recipes (three-sided block, angled hole).\r\n- `continuous-4-axis.md`: Rotary Contour/Parallel/Offset; recipe.\r\n- `simultaneous-5-axis.md`: the seven 5-axis operations, lead/lag/max tilt, shank avoid; recipe.\r\n- `checks.md`: machine check, tilt tolerance (#938/#973), shank/holder, index swing and its #1107 gap, refused vs warned.\r\n\r\n## Claims verified (by reading code on upstream/main 0757563d)\r\n- Op names/params/limits: `OpParams` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/params.rs`, `sane.rs` (lead/lag within +-90, max tilt in (0,180], tilt A in [-90,90], B in [-180,180]), UI labels in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/{fields,kind_editors}.rs`.\r\n- Which ops carry a tilt: `OpParams::tilt()` (Drill and all 5-axis/rotary/turning kinds do not).\r\n- Machine rotaries: `grep rotary assets/machines/*.mch` (only 4 files).\r\n- TCP: `machine.rtcp` rule in `crates/post/src/post/machine.rs`; G43.4 in `fanuc.cps`, `doosan-dnm.cps`; tilt refusals in haas/heidenhain/mazak/sinumerik/carvera; tormach A-index law.\r\n- Checks: `crates/app/src/machine/judge.rs`, `posting_index_swing.rs`, `crates/post/src/machine/swing.rs`, `stock_sim.rs` \"refuse_unjudged\"; warnings block the post (`posting.rs`).\r\n- Rotary ops: axis is fitted from the mesh, letter gated by `rotary_gate.rs`.\r\n\r\n## Stated as not implemented / open\r\nTilted drilling cycles; wrapping a 2D drawing around a cylinder; inverse-time feed (no G93 in any shipped post); singularity detection; spindle-body collision (body size is parsed but unused); stock simulation of posed programs (\"not judged\"); index-swing vs table/plate (#1107); the #938 tolerance (PR #973 is unmerged, so main still compares exactly); #950 A0 assumption.\r\n\r\n## Left out as unverifiable\r\nReal-control behaviour at singularities and rollover.\r\n\r\n## Review fixes\r\n- `continuous-4-axis.md` and `simultaneous-5-axis.md` no longer repeat the per-operation tables and settings; they link to the merged `operations-multiaxis.md` (#1272) and keep only machine and post needs, feed, checks, recipes and not-implemented notes.\r\n- `machines.md` links to the multi-axis section; the old absolute links are now `@/` links.\r\n- Merged main (`guide/_index.md`: both entries kept). `zola` is not installed here; every `@/` link was checked by hand to point at an existing file.\r\n\r\nChangelog: none\r\n\r\nFixes #1279\r\n\r\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\r\n\r\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL\r\n\r\n",
